Re: Plumbing request, Flat 10, 130 Lantern Quay, Willowbank, ZZ5 1ZZ (toilet flush mechanism, second WC) — approved to proceed at £172.51 + VAT on 19/10/2026.

You have reported the job complete with an invoice uploaded, but the invoice file on our system is unreadable and our booking record for this job carries a different address and date to this property. Before we pass anything to the landlord, please reply with:
1. a legible copy of the invoice (amount, VAT, property address);
2. the date and time your engineer attended, and the full address attended;
3. confirmation of the work carried out and any photos.

Please reply within 3 working days. If we do not hear back we will treat the job as unverified and will not forward the invoice for payment.
